quran[9]{c,v,t}:
  48,1,"(O Prophet!) Indeed, We have opened for you (the path to) a clear victory,"
  48,2,"so, for your sake, Allah may forgive the past faults of your community* and their future shortcomings. And He may complete His Blessing upon you, and guide you upon a straight path."
  48,3,And that Allah may help you with tremendously strong support.
  48,4,"He is the One Who sent down tranquillity into the hearts of the believers so that they might increase in faith along with their (existing) faith. To Allah belong the forces of the heavens and the earth. And Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise."
  48,5,So He may cause the believing men and the believing women to enter Gardens with streams flowing forever. And that He may absolve them of their misdeeds. And that is a great success in the sight of Allah.
  48,6,"And He may punish the hypocritic men and the hypocritic women and the polytheistic men and the polytheistic women, who entertain evil assumptions about Allah. They will be encircled by evil. And Allah has afflicted them with His wrath, cursed them and prepared Hell for them. And it is an evil destination."
  48,7,"To Allah belong the forces of the heavens and the earth, and Allah is All-Mighty, All-Wise."
  48,8,"Indeed, We have sent you as a Witness, a Bearer of glad tidings and a Warner."
  48,9,"So that you may believe in Allah and His Messenger (blessings and peace be upon him), support him and revere him exaltedly. And (with that) you may glorify Him morning and evening."
